# M026 S04: build context for the 5 internal Flask UI containers
# (licenses, help, config, backup-management, setup) is now ./core/
# instead of ./core/<container>/. Each Dockerfile only needs its own
# subdir + common/ — sibling subdirs would just bloat the build context
# and trigger needless cache invalidations.
#
# Note: we deliberately do NOT exclude sibling subdirs here, because
# Docker still has to resolve the per-container `COPY <subdir>/...`
# lines from the context. Excluding them would break the build. We
# only filter the obvious churn (caches, build artifacts, .git).
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.git/
